  "description": "Based on the popular webtoon! A special fantasy romance visual novel arrives, unfolding in a small modern city cafe with 'Kim Sam-wol,' a nine-tailed fox who has lived for 3,000 years. Why did she, who sought to become a deity by eating human livers, awaken as an ordinary human and work part-time at a cafe?\n\nIn-depth Narrative and Multiple Endings\nA high-quality story where Korean mythology meets modern sensibilities. Depending on your choices, Sam-wol can become a deity, choose human love, or even disappear.\n\nLively Production and Voice Acting\nBeyond simple images, 'Spine animation' and 'full voice' support for all characters except the protagonist provide an immersive experience as if watching an animation.\n\nHeart-Touching Sound\nThe original OST, with participation from Shin Jun-ki, the bassist of the band 'BUZZ,' enriches the game's emotional depth.\n\nDetective-Style Cafe Mini-Game\nFind clues hidden in the conversations of customers and create the perfect drink. You can enjoy both cafe management and the fun of deduction at the same time.",
